[{"id":"intalaqa-18-71-0","words":["verb:intalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa su krenuli","en":"so they (two) set off"},{"bs":"idite","en":"go off"},{"bs":"i krenuo je","en":"and he/it set off"},{"bs":"(ne) razvezuje se","en":"(does not) speak freely"}],"ref":"18:71","answerWord":"فَٱنطَلَقَا","answerSound":"audio/9c75f96dae080e1cd78e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So they twain set out till, when they were in the ship, he made a hole therein. (Moses) said: Hast thou made a hole therein to drown the folk thereof? Thou verily hast done a dreadful thing.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"krenuti, otići","en":"to set off, to depart"},"passage":["فَٱنطَلَقَا","حَتَّىٰٓ","إِذَا","رَكِبَا","فِى","ٱلسَّفِينَةِ","خَرَقَهَا","قَالَ","أَخَرَقْتَهَا","لِتُغْرِقَ","أَهْلَهَا","لَقَدْ","جِئْتَ","شَيْـًٔا","إِمْرًا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"انطَلَقَ"}},{"id":"intalaqa-77-29-0","words":["verb:intalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"idite","en":"go off"},{"bs":"pa su krenuli","en":"so they set off"},{"bs":"(ne) razvezuje se","en":"(does not) speak freely"},{"bs":"krenuli ste","en":"you (all) set off"}],"ref":"77:29","answerWord":"ٱنطَلِقُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/c011fc4ea631d56577d7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(It will be said unto them:) Depart unto that (doom) which ye used to deny;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"krenuti, otići","en":"to set off, to depart"},"passage":["ٱنطَلِقُوٓا۟","إِلَىٰ","مَا","كُنتُم","بِهِۦ","تُكَذِّبُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"انطَلَقَ"}},{"id":"intalaqa-26-13-3","words":["verb:intalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"(ne) razvezuje se","en":"(does not) speak freely"},{"bs":"pa su krenuli","en":"so they (two) set off"},{"bs":"idite","en":"go off"},{"bs":"krenuli ste","en":"you (all) set off"}],"ref":"26:13","answerWord":"يَنطَلِقُ","answerSound":"audio/1de74c6f7ff501e998f5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And I shall be embarrassed, and my tongue will not speak plainly, therefor send for Aaron (to help me).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"krenuti, otići","en":"to set off, to depart"},"passage":["وَيَضِيقُ","صَدْرِى","وَلَا","يَنطَلِقُ","لِسَانِى","فَأَرْسِلْ","إِلَىٰ","هَٰرُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"انطَلَقَ"}},{"id":"intalaqa-38-6-0","words":["verb:intalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"i krenuo je","en":"and he/it set off"},{"bs":"(ne) razvezuje se","en":"(does not) speak freely"},{"bs":"pa su krenuli","en":"so they (two) set off"},{"bs":"krenuli ste","en":"you (all) set off"}],"ref":"38:6","answerWord":"وَٱنطَلَقَ","answerSound":"audio/39115ea81a1fde8fbcbb.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The chiefs among them go about, exhorting: Go and be staunch to your gods! Lo! this is a thing designed.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"krenuti, otići","en":"to set off, to depart"},"passage":["وَٱنطَلَقَ","ٱلْمَلَأُ","مِنْهُمْ","أَنِ","ٱمْشُوا۟","وَٱصْبِرُوا۟","عَلَىٰٓ","ءَالِهَتِكُمْ","إِنَّ","هَٰذَا","لَشَىْءٌ","يُرَادُ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"انطَلَقَ"}},{"id":"intalaqa-68-23-0","words":["verb:intalaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa su krenuli","en":"so they set off"},{"bs":"krenuli ste","en":"you (all) set off"},{"bs":"i krenuo je","en":"and he/it set off"},{"bs":"idite","en":"go off"}],"ref":"68:23","answerWord":"فَٱنطَلَقُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/cccf2740fc680996d6ac.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So they went off, saying one unto another in low tones:","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"krenuti, otići","en":"to set off, to depart"},"passage":["فَٱنطَلَقُوا۟","وَهُمْ","يَتَخَٰفَتُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"انطَلَقَ"}},{"id":"tahhara-3-42-7","words":["verb:tahhara"],"options":[{"bs":"i očistio te je","en":"and He purified you"},{"bs":"da vas pročisti","en":"so that he/it may purify you (all)"},{"bs":"pročišćava","en":"he/it purifies"},{"bs":"i očisti!","en":"and purify!"}],"ref":"3:42","answerWord":"وَطَهَّرَكِ","answerSound":"audio/787db686835db281fd3e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when the angels said: O Mary! Lo! Allah hath chosen thee and made thee pure, and hath preferred thee above (all) the women of creation.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"očistiti, pročistiti","en":"to purify, to clean"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","قَالَتِ","ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةُ","يَٰمَرْيَمُ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","ٱصْطَفَىٰكِ","وَطَهَّرَكِ","وَٱصْطَفَىٰكِ","عَلَىٰ","نِسَآءِ","ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"طَهَّرَ"}},{"id":"tahhara-8-11-10","words":["verb:tahhara"],"options":[{"bs":"da vas pročisti","en":"so that he/it may purify you (all)"},{"bs":"i očistio te je","en":"and He purified you"},{"bs":"i očisti!","en":"and purify!"},{"bs":"pročišćava","en":"he/it purifies"}],"ref":"8:11","answerWord":"لِّيُطَهِّرَكُم","answerSound":"audio/8a8677f9cb197003c340.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"When He made the slumber fall upon you as a reassurance from him and sent down water from the sky upon you, that thereby He might purify you, and remove from you the fear of Satan, and make strong your hearts and firm (your) feet thereby.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"očistiti, pročistiti","en":"to purify, to clean"},"passage":["إِذْ","يُغَشِّيكُمُ","ٱلنُّعَاسَ","أَمَنَةً","مِّنْهُ","وَيُنَزِّلُ","عَلَيْكُم","مِّنَ","ٱلسَّمَآءِ","مَآءً","لِّيُطَهِّرَكُم","بِهِۦ","وَيُذْهِبَ","عَنكُمْ","رِجْزَ","ٱلشَّيْطَٰنِ","وَلِيَرْبِطَ","عَلَىٰ","قُلُوبِكُمْ","وَيُثَبِّتَ","بِهِ","ٱلْأَقْدَامَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"طَهَّرَ"}},{"id":"tahhara-22-26-10","words":["verb:tahhara"],"options":[{"bs":"i očisti!","en":"and purify!"},{"bs":"i očistio te je","en":"and He purified you"},{"bs":"da vas pročisti","en":"so that he/it may purify you (all)"},{"bs":"pročišćava","en":"he/it purifies"}],"ref":"22:26","answerWord":"وَطَهِّرْ","answerSound":"audio/2769399b8918f24e40d3.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (remember) when We prepared for Abraham the place of the (holy) House, saying: Ascribe thou no thing as partner unto Me, and purify My House for those who make the round (thereof) and those who stand and those who bow and make prostration.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"očistiti, pročistiti","en":"to purify, to clean"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","بَوَّأْنَا","لِإِبْرَٰهِيمَ","مَكَانَ","ٱلْبَيْتِ","أَن","لَّا","تُشْرِكْ","بِى","شَيْـًٔا","وَطَهِّرْ","بَيْتِىَ","لِلطَّآئِفِينَ","وَٱلْقَآئِمِينَ","وَٱلرُّكَّعِ","ٱلسُّجُودِ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"طَهَّرَ"}},{"id":"tahhara-33-33-23","words":["verb:tahhara"],"options":[{"bs":"i pročišćava vas","en":"and he/it purifies you (all)"},{"bs":"i očistio te je","en":"and He purified you"},{"bs":"i očisti!","en":"and purify!"},{"bs":"pročišćava","en":"he/it purifies"}],"ref":"33:33","answerWord":"وَيُطَهِّرَكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/2c61b7cf3201e4a21b78.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And stay in your houses. Bedizen not yourselves with the bedizenment of the Time of Ignorance. Be regular in prayer, and pay the poor-due, and obey Allah and His messenger. Allah's wish is but to remove uncleanness far from you, O Folk of the Household, and cleanse you with a thorough cleansing.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"očistiti, pročistiti","en":"to purify, to clean"},"passage":["وَقَرْنَ","فِى","بُيُوتِكُنَّ","وَلَا","تَبَرَّجْنَ","تَبَرُّجَ","ٱلْجَٰهِلِيَّةِ","ٱلْأُولَىٰ","وَأَقِمْنَ","ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","وَءَاتِينَ","ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ","وَأَطِعْنَ","ٱللَّهَ","وَرَسُولَهُۥٓ","إِنَّمَا","يُرِيدُ","ٱللَّهُ","لِيُذْهِبَ","عَنكُمُ","ٱلرِّجْسَ","أَهْلَ","ٱلْبَيْتِ","وَيُطَهِّرَكُمْ","تَطْهِيرًا"],"marked":[23],"facts":{"verb":"طَهَّرَ"}},{"id":"tahhara-74-4-1","words":["verb:tahhara"],"options":[{"bs":"pa očisti!","en":"so purify!"},{"bs":"i pročišćava vas","en":"and he/it purifies you (all)"},{"bs":"pročišćava","en":"he/it purifies"},{"bs":"i očistio te je","en":"and He purified you"}],"ref":"74:4","answerWord":"فَطَهِّرْ","answerSound":"audio/a5bef47dfe88d9dc0f54.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Thy raiment purify,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"očistiti, pročistiti","en":"to purify, to clean"},"passage":["وَثِيَابَكَ","فَطَهِّرْ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"طَهَّرَ"}}]